nt": "I turn off my phone on a regular basis, because I just want peace.\n\nMy brother called me and no answer.\n\nHe called my ex who then called my turned off phone.\n\nMy ex went on FB and PM'd a local friend.\n\nMy friend then called our local pub.\n\nThe bartender/manager went next door to the local haberdasher.\n\nI get a knock on my door, and Allen is standing there in a linen jacket and smoking a cigar.  \"You need to call your ex.\"\n\n\"Why\", I asked.\n\n\"I don't fucking know\", he answered.\n\nI love living in a small town.\n ", "author": "KuzoKevin", "created": 1785574029742, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "thegoldencalf", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Here's how I found out my younger sister died through modern technology...", "last_comment_created": 1785578293381, "content": "<p>I turn off my phone on a regular basis, because I just want peace.</p>\n<p>My brother called me and no answer.</p>\n<p>He called my ex who then called my turned off phone.</p>\n<p>My ex went on FB and PM'd a local friend.</p>\n<p>My friend then called our local pub.</p>\n<p>The bartender/manager went next door to the local haberdasher.</p>\n<p>I get a knock on my door, and Allen is standing there in a linen jacket and smoking a cigar.  &quot;You need to call your ex.&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Why&quot;, I asked.</p>\n<p>&quot;I don't fucking know&quot;, he answered.</p>\n<p>I love living in a small town.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 19, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "